![Launch V3 Screenshot](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lucide-react/lucide/main/icons/shield-check.svg)

### 2. "Warm-Restart" Maintenance Protocol
To prevent "file in use" errors during updates, all agents now listen for a maintenance signal.

- **Activate Maintenance**: `npx tsx scripts/maintenance_mode.ts on`
  - Agents will gracefully log out and shut down.
- **Deactivate Maintenance**: `npx tsx scripts/maintenance_mode.ts off`
  - System resumes autonomous cycles.

### 3. Unified Monitoring
Use `pm2 monit` to see all 4 streams in a single, high-visibility dashboard:

```bash
pm2 monit
```

